# Nawal Yoga Project

## Stack
- **Live app:** Next.js 15 (App Router) in `web/` — TypeScript, Tailwind CSS v4, Framer Motion, GSAP, Lenis.
- Develop: `cd web && npm run dev`. Deploy with Vercel Root Directory = `web`.

