Use clean lowercase folder names and URL-safe filenames (no spaces).

## Language (i18n)
- **EN / AR** via `web/src/lib/i18n/`.
- Prefer dictionary keys in `dictionaries.ts` and page-specific copy modules.
- When `lang="ar"`, `dir="rtl"` is set on `<html>`. Arabic fonts: headings **Amiri**, body **Scheherazade New**.

## Arabic terms
Workshop names in Arabic: **الطيرة** (Al-Tira), **حيفا** (Haifa), **ريتريت** (Retreat).

## Paths
- App code lives under `web/src/`.
- Public assets: `/media/...` (served from `public/media` via junction).
- Import alias: `@/*` → `web/src/*`.
